00:00:34.790 --> 00:00:37.080
<i>Everyone's chiming in to just say</i>

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:39.200
<i>Now, get on your feet, dauntlessly</i>

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:41.500
<i>Once you grab the microphone, naturally</i>

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:43.330
<i>We're going to go wild, so check it out</i>

00:00:43.330 --> 00:00:45.690
<i>For tonight, the very best dinner</i>

00:00:45.690 --> 00:00:47.660
<i>Words going beyond even the color of skin</i>

00:00:47.660 --> 00:00:51.290
<i>This universal vibration</i>

00:00:51.290 --> 00:00:53.070
<i>Yeah, come on!</i>

00:00:53.070 --> 00:00:55.580
<i>You gonna feel so</i>

00:00:55.580 --> 00:00:58.780
<i>Yeah, come on!</i>

00:00:58.780 --> 00:01:04.410
<i>Before the time comes
when there's no turning back</i>

00:01:04.410 --> 00:01:07.250
<i>Let's turn things in a positive direction</i>

00:01:07.250 --> 00:01:13.830
<i>If you don't take action,
you won't get anywhere</i>

00:01:16.090 --> 00:01:18.160
<i>Never gonna stop, never gonna stop</i>

00:01:18.160 --> 00:01:20.600
<i>The feeling of love is happiness</i>

00:01:20.600 --> 00:01:22.540
