<i>Yeah, come on!</i>

00:01:45.410 --> 00:01:49.000
Chapter 21 Battle Array

00:02:42.080 --> 00:02:43.510
I wouldn't open it if I were you.

00:02:46.660 --> 00:02:48.430
He'll bite you.

00:02:48.620 --> 00:02:49.740
I'm sorry.

00:02:51.410 --> 00:02:52.610
For what?

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:57.110
I don't know what I should say...

00:03:05.870 --> 00:03:09.740
I thought I knew what sort of
emotional scar he'd suffered...

00:03:10.790 --> 00:03:13.290
But you did know...

00:03:13.290 --> 00:03:15.200
Just as you said,

00:03:15.200 --> 00:03:18.260
it wasn't something that
was going to heal so easily.

00:03:20.160 --> 00:03:21.130
But still,

00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:25.550
who could possibly know
just how deep it went?

00:03:26.410 --> 00:03:29.450
It's not something you can see or touch,

00:03:29.450 --> 00:03:32.100
and it's doubly true when
he'd forgotten about it himself.

00:03:32.750 --> 00:03:34.100
About all I know of him

00:03:34.950 --> 00:03:39.000
is that, surrounded by fire, he saw
our parents killed right before his eyes,

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:43.110
and his mind broke as he smelled
their bodies being burned.

00:03:43.540 --> 00:03:47.120
And now, he's trapped in there again!

00:03:52.160 --> 00:03:53.540
You know...

00:03:54.660 --> 00:03:56.940
he hasn't changed one bit
in these last two years.

00:04:17.200 --> 00:04:19.720
I spent two years, suturing that wound...

00:04:24.410 --> 00:04:25.630
<i>Two years...</i>

00:04:40.540 --> 00:04:41.960
<i>Two years.</i>

00:04:43.870 --> 00:04:46.720
<i>How many years will it be for me?</i>

00:05:00.290 --> 00:05:01.690
Say, Furutaka...

00:05:03.910 --> 00:05:05.870
Hurry up and end your own misery.

00:05:05.870 --> 00:05:09.910
We've known all about your
plans for a long time now.

00:05:09.910 --> 00:05:13.160
Ever since that crazed
arsonist bastard came here.

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:19.450
I hear you've got a lot of Choshu
clansmen cooped up somewhere.

00:05:19.450 --> 00:05:22.430
Either way, the time for games is over.

00:05:31.040 --> 00:05:33.370
We were to choose a windy night

00:05:33.370 --> 00:05:36.980
and set fire windward
of the imperial palace.

00:05:38.620 --> 00:05:43.080
As the Lord of Aizu headed for the palace
in this crisis, we were to kill him...

00:05:44.120 --> 00:05:49.390
And we were to rescue His Majesty
and take him to Choshu...

00:06:06.620 --> 00:06:08.380
You fools...

00:06:25.830 --> 00:06:27.040
Why?

00:07:04.700 --> 00:07:06.280
Tomorrow we'll see the
tall festival floats,

00:07:06.700 --> 00:07:08.990
and the day after will
be the Gion Festival.

00:07:10.650 --> 00:07:12.740
I can hardly wait.

00:07:16.830 --> 00:07:18.580
The Gion Festival...

00:07:31.580 --> 00:07:34.790
Mr. Yoshida, why won't you go
to the Choshu Clan House?

00:07:34.790 --> 00:07:38.100
If we stay here, there's no knowing
when a patrol might come by.

00:07:38.580 --> 00:07:42.600
Surely you would be
protected at the Clan House.

00:07:43.160 --> 00:07:46.910
The Clan House is likely in
an uproar right about now.

00:07:46.910 --> 00:07:51.370
Katsura will have his hands full
trying to calm the ronin

00:07:51.370 --> 00:07:54.870
as they clamor to attack Mibu
and take back Furutaka.

00:07:56.410 --> 00:08:00.000
If I go there now, I must
sympathize with Katsura.

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:01.750
All will be back to where we started

00:08:01.750 --> 00:08:03.680
and the cause of the
revolution will collapse.

00:08:07.250 --> 00:08:09.580
Master Miyabe...

00:08:09.580 --> 00:08:12.300
Do you not wish to see the dawn?

00:08:12.700 --> 00:08:16.350
Do you wish to plunge this nation
into darkness once again?

00:08:17.330 --> 00:08:18.830
No.

00:08:18.830 --> 00:08:23.450
A revolution must take place,
even if it costs us our lives.

00:08:23.450 --> 00:08:28.020
That is exactly why we must not
act rashly and destroy ourselves.

00:08:32.700 --> 00:08:33.950
Master Miyabe.

00:08:33.950 --> 00:08:35.910
The location of the
meeting has been decided.

00:08:35.910 --> 00:08:38.030
It will be at Ikedaya near
the Sanjo Kobashi Bridge.

00:08:38.950 --> 00:08:42.660
It seems the Shinsengumi
are stirring, so please be careful.

00:08:47.250 --> 00:08:48.660
And you?

00:08:48.660 --> 00:08:51.290
My page has yet to return.

00:08:51.290 --> 00:08:53.720
I shall see you at the meeting place later.

00:09:01.040 --> 00:09:03.160
Master Shoin...

00:09:03.160 --> 00:09:06.080
Please grant your
protection to us patriots.

00:09:09.580 --> 00:09:13.360
Moving out! All members,
get ready immediately!

00:09:14.790 --> 00:09:16.200
All members mobilize!

00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:20.330
Everyone is to gather at the meeting
place in Gion in twos and threes!

00:09:28.910 --> 00:09:31.620
<i>Drinking water from sake
cups before going to war...</i>

00:09:38.330 --> 00:09:39.830
Furutaka spilled it.

00:09:39.830 --> 00:09:43.910
We're going on an inn-by-inn
search of Kyoto now.

00:09:43.910 --> 00:09:44.860
I see.

00:09:47.160 --> 00:09:53.000
Oh, I am going to the main Kurotani
camp to request reinforcements.

00:09:53.000 --> 00:09:54.110
Pardon me.

00:09:56.330 --> 00:09:59.040
As for me, you can see for yourself...

00:09:59.040 --> 00:10:02.740
I am sorry to be of no use
at such a critical time.

00:10:03.330 --> 00:10:04.500
Don't worry.

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:07.330
I won't go so far as to demand
that the sick go as well.

00:10:07.330 --> 00:10:09.290
Even if he is a Vice Commander.

00:10:20.080 --> 00:10:22.460
I am truly sorry.

00:10:25.500 --> 00:10:29.330
I was not able to carry out your orders.

00:10:29.330 --> 00:10:31.980
I will accept any punishment.

00:10:36.450 --> 00:10:37.530
Suzu.

00:10:38.080 --> 00:10:42.370
It seems you do not yet
understand what honor is.

00:10:42.370 --> 00:10:44.330
Do not lose yourself in your emotions.

00:10:44.330 --> 00:10:46.540
You must not let a momentary
feeling carry you away.

00:10:49.700 --> 00:10:52.000
Master, where are you going?

00:10:52.200 --> 00:10:54.870
Matsuda came to notify us earlier.

00:10:54.870 --> 00:10:57.080
There is a meeting at Ikedaya.

00:10:57.080 --> 00:10:58.340
I shall accompany you.

00:10:58.910 --> 00:11:01.000
You are suspended from your duties.

00:11:01.000 --> 00:11:03.350
Remain here until I return.

00:11:06.040 --> 00:11:07.520
Mas...

00:11:11.330 --> 00:11:12.520
Master...

00:11:40.370 --> 00:11:41.760
Reporting in, sir.

00:11:42.250 --> 00:11:46.470
We are currently combing the area
for the Choshu meeting place,

00:11:46.830 --> 00:11:49.160
but we have been unable to
determine the location as of yet.

00:11:49.160 --> 00:11:52.560
There is no sign of such a meeting
around here near Gion, either.

00:11:53.290 --> 00:11:56.040
With regards to the mobilization request
sent to the main Kurotani camp,

00:11:56.040 --> 00:11:59.200
the troops have not yet arrived.

00:11:59.200 --> 00:12:01.410
We believe they are likely suffering delays

00:12:01.410 --> 00:12:03.570
due to trouble contacting
the military governor.

00:12:04.250 --> 00:12:07.500
Soji, how many members are
available for mobilization?

00:12:07.500 --> 00:12:08.950
Thirty-four.

00:12:09.160 --> 00:12:11.160
Thirty-four?!

00:12:12.290 --> 00:12:15.160
What the hell're you guys doing,
growing smaller in number?!

00:12:15.160 --> 00:12:18.130
Hey, hey, what's the point in
yelling at the ones who are here?

00:12:18.620 --> 00:12:22.830
But seriously, these sons of Japan
deserting and getting aggravated colds...

00:12:22.830 --> 00:12:25.910
Makes you want to ask
if they've even got balls.

00:12:25.910 --> 00:12:27.290
Todo...

00:12:27.290 --> 00:12:31.080
you're forgetting that Mr. Yamanami
has a cold too, aren't you?

00:12:32.540 --> 00:12:35.980
Don't tell what I just said to
Mr. Yamanami, even if I die, okay?

00:12:36.330 --> 00:12:39.070
So, what're we going to do, Vice Commander?

00:12:41.000 --> 00:12:42.400
Vice Commander.

00:12:42.950 --> 00:12:45.000
According to Furutaka's confession,

00:12:45.000 --> 00:12:47.950
there are about forty ronin in the city.

00:12:47.950 --> 00:12:50.700
And there may be more men
that we do not know about.

00:12:51.160 --> 00:12:55.580
I believe we should wait for Aizu's
reinforcements until the appointed time.

00:12:55.790 --> 00:12:58.200
If we wait until then,

00:12:58.200 --> 00:13:00.380
all the ronin will have escaped!
Uh-huh.

00:13:00.830 --> 00:13:02.040
And even if that doesn't happen,

00:13:02.040 --> 00:13:04.870
all the guys're awfully keyed up

00:13:04.870 --> 00:13:06.640
because we haven't been
on a sweep in a while!

00:13:07.120 --> 00:13:07.900
Vice Commander!

00:13:14.870 --> 00:13:16.300
Let's go, Toshi.

00:13:24.830 --> 00:13:29.160
The Shinsengumi isn't so patient
that it can wait much longer...

00:13:29.850 --> 00:13:30.490
Right?

00:13:35.040 --> 00:13:38.080
I had a feeling you would say that.

00:13:42.080 --> 00:13:45.500
That's the spirit!

00:13:45.500 --> 00:13:47.410
We wouldn't be the Shinsengumi otherwise!

00:13:47.410 --> 00:13:49.450
Now that it's decided,
let's strike while the iron's hot!

00:13:49.450 --> 00:13:51.620
All right, you guys, we're moving out!

00:13:51.620 --> 00:13:54.200
Yeah!!

00:13:57.200 --> 00:13:59.190
Now, to divide the units.

00:14:00.620 --> 00:14:03.750
There are a lot of suspicious
areas east of the Kamo River.

00:14:03.750 --> 00:14:09.700
Toshi, take Harada, Saito,
and twenty-two men to search over there.

00:14:09.700 --> 00:14:13.470
Soji, Nagakura, Todo,
and the rest, come with me.

00:14:17.120 --> 00:14:19.370
Still, it certainly has
been a while, hasn't it?

00:14:19.750 --> 00:14:21.000
What's this?

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:23.840
We just made some arrests
this morning at Masuya's.

00:14:24.040 --> 00:14:25.450
Oh, please.

00:14:25.450 --> 00:14:28.660
I meant getting to see
Master Kondo cutting a valiant figure.

00:14:28.660 --> 00:14:31.580
All you've done is meet
with important people,

00:14:31.580 --> 00:14:33.760
and you haven't even set foot
in the training hall lately.

00:14:35.290 --> 00:14:38.040
Huh? Wasn't he just going
to his mistress's all the time?

00:14:38.040 --> 00:14:39.750
We're not supposed to talk about that.

00:14:39.750 --> 00:14:42.440
Well, I don't know about
cutting a valiant figure,

00:14:42.790 --> 00:14:45.040
but if tonight had been
Tetsu's first battle,

00:14:45.040 --> 00:14:47.280
it would've been a fine example
to set as the Commander.

00:14:47.750 --> 00:14:50.200
Especially since his uniform
and sword were made in time, too.

00:14:53.120 --> 00:14:55.910
I suppose there's just no
helping a cold, though.

00:14:56.660 --> 00:14:57.340
Yes.

00:15:17.580 --> 00:15:19.040
We're doing a sweep!

00:15:19.040 --> 00:15:20.520
Let's go, you guys!

00:15:21.750 --> 00:15:23.200
Don't overlook a single establishment!

00:15:23.200 --> 00:15:24.230
Yes, sir!

00:15:36.370 --> 00:15:37.620
<i>Nan...</i>

00:15:38.580 --> 00:15:39.960
<i>Mr. Sannan...</i>

00:15:42.040 --> 00:15:43.960
<i>Hey, Mr. Sannan.</i>

00:15:50.200 --> 00:15:51.540
What's the matter?

00:15:51.540 --> 00:15:53.640
We're going to end up leaving you behind.

00:15:59.660 --> 00:16:01.000
Hijikata...

00:16:01.000 --> 00:16:02.660
The Commander was...

00:16:02.660 --> 00:16:06.410
Mr. Serizawa was still,
at the very least, our comrade.

00:16:06.410 --> 00:16:09.030
Why? Why did it have to...?

00:16:11.370 --> 00:16:12.410
What for?

00:16:13.540 --> 00:16:15.700
Why, Hijikata?!

00:16:25.200 --> 00:16:26.840
Are you serious?

00:16:27.700 --> 00:16:29.520
Do you seriously mean what you said?!

00:16:33.580 --> 00:16:34.720
Wait!

00:16:36.410 --> 00:16:38.080
Hijikata, stop!

00:16:41.950 --> 00:16:43.050
Hijikata...

00:16:53.540 --> 00:16:55.800
That dream again...

00:16:58.620 --> 00:17:00.790
Mr. Yamanami, you shouldn't be doing this!

00:17:00.790 --> 00:17:02.870
You shouldn't be dressed
so lightly when you're ill.

00:17:03.200 --> 00:17:06.330
Oh, is that my meal? Thank you.

00:17:08.540 --> 00:17:11.000
I made some rice porridge...

00:17:11.000 --> 00:17:12.210
Do you think you can eat it?

00:17:16.120 --> 00:17:20.060
I dislike having to hold a sword...

00:17:21.580 --> 00:17:22.870
What?

00:17:22.870 --> 00:17:25.480
Does that mean...?

00:17:25.870 --> 00:17:28.830
Ever since the previous
Commander passed away,

00:17:28.830 --> 00:17:30.800
scenes of bloodshed simply
have not sat well with me.

00:17:31.910 --> 00:17:33.210
I see...

00:17:35.950 --> 00:17:38.440
Then, you'll have a normal meal, won't you?

00:17:39.950 --> 00:17:41.500
Please wait a moment.

00:17:41.500 --> 00:17:44.500
There's some side dishes like
broiled fish, so I'll bring them.

00:17:44.500 --> 00:17:45.830
Thank you.

00:17:47.000 --> 00:17:49.660
This may be rude of me to say, but...

00:17:49.660 --> 00:17:51.660
I feel the same as you, Mr. Yamanami.

00:17:53.370 --> 00:17:56.220
Facing blood and things of
that sort isn't my forte...

00:17:56.860 --> 00:17:57.850
nor is it my brother's.

00:18:27.830 --> 00:18:30.420
What the heck? You're awake.

00:18:35.160 --> 00:18:38.220
Let... go...

00:18:39.050 --> 00:18:40.590
My fingers're hurting.

00:18:52.250 --> 00:18:55.160
What're you so afraid of?

00:18:55.160 --> 00:18:56.480
It's not like I'm going to bite.

00:18:57.250 --> 00:18:59.990
I'm just going to clock you good.

00:19:00.410 --> 00:19:04.330
Do you know what's
going on outside right now?

00:19:04.330 --> 00:19:09.000
They're out to crash a meeting being
held by the Choshu you hate so much.

00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:12.450
The people who're able to go out
today number just thirty-four.

00:19:12.450 --> 00:19:14.580
They don't even know
where the meeting's at.

00:19:14.580 --> 00:19:17.960
But if they don't go, the city
of Kyoto'll end up a sea of fire.

00:19:18.410 --> 00:19:20.450
And even while these things're happening,

00:19:20.450 --> 00:19:22.680
you haven't said a word about being
allowed to go with them, have you?

00:19:24.120 --> 00:19:26.120
You sought sympathy,
saying you wanted revenge.

00:19:26.120 --> 00:19:28.520
You joined up, asking to
be turned into a demon.

00:19:28.950 --> 00:19:31.410
You whine that you can't kill people.

00:19:31.410 --> 00:19:33.230
And when push comes to shove,
you shut yourself away?

00:19:35.080 --> 00:19:37.700
I've had enough of your bullshit!

00:19:37.700 --> 00:19:40.200
You damn brat!

00:19:40.450 --> 00:19:43.330
I haven't heard what the hell went on!

00:19:43.330 --> 00:19:47.490
After all, there've been loads of facts
of life you haven't been able to face!

00:19:47.490 --> 00:19:50.580
You don't want to kill!
Nor do you want to be killed!

00:19:50.580 --> 00:19:52.950
You don't even care about
avenging your parents now?!

00:19:52.950 --> 00:19:54.420
In that case...

00:19:54.420 --> 00:19:56.460
don't you sign up to
join the Shinsengumi!

00:20:03.830 --> 00:20:07.450
Here's your shroud and sword
from Vice Commander Hijikata.

00:20:07.450 --> 00:20:09.620
He said you may be a wretched brat,

00:20:09.620 --> 00:20:12.310
but at least go die like a
member of the Shinsengumi.

00:20:22.860 --> 00:20:26.830
What are you doing, you bastard?!

00:20:35.660 --> 00:20:37.950
You don't even know what
condition Tetsu's in!

00:20:37.950 --> 00:20:39.750
Don't mess with him just
because you feel like it!

00:20:40.330 --> 00:20:44.340
Do you really want your kid
brother to come out of there?

00:20:46.450 --> 00:20:47.930
You don't, do you?

00:20:48.790 --> 00:20:50.810
Somewhere in your heart,
you feel relieved, don't you?

00:21:08.950 --> 00:21:10.060
Don't run away.

00:21:26.760 --> 00:21:31.410
1864 (Genji I)
June 5th, Ten at night

00:21:34.910 --> 00:21:37.900
Ikedaya

00:22:02.620 --> 00:22:06.910
<i>Gripping the microphone tight,
the hit parade's on parade</i>

00:22:06.910 --> 00:22:10.390
<i>Hey, Jimmy, how you feeling?</i>

00:22:10.390 --> 00:22:14.790
<i>Quite the gentleman when he's off stage</i>

00:22:14.790 --> 00:22:18.450
<i>Hey, Jimmy, a generous spirit too!</i>

00:22:18.450 --> 00:22:22.360
<i>Being such an honest guy,
even his life's plain</i>

00:22:22.360 --> 00:22:26.290
<i>Keep building it up patiently</i>

00:22:26.290 --> 00:22:30.290
<i>May your dreams come true honestly</i>

00:22:30.290 --> 00:22:33.990
<i>Let's go for it again today, Jimmy</i>

00:22:35.950 --> 00:22:39.660
<i>You got to fight for your money!
How you feeling, Jimmy?</i>

00:22:39.660 --> 00:22:43.500
<i>You got to fight for your dream,
it's all too much</i>

00:22:43.500 --> 00:22:47.500
<i>You got to fight for your money!
How you feeling, Jimmy?</i>

00:22:47.500 --> 00:22:51.550
<i>You got to fight for your dream,
it's all too much</i>

00:23:07.190 --> 00:23:11.030
<i>You got to fight for your money!
How you feeling, Jimmy?</i>

00:23:11.030 --> 00:23:15.330
